  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped carrot and celery and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped Korean pear and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, tomato paste, and dried thyme, and stir to combine.",
    "Bring the stew to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Season the stew with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
